<div class="calcpad-output">
 <!-- Renders the [Mandelbrot set](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mandelbrot_set) and a deep-zoom inset by mapping each grid point through the iterated quadratic $z_{n+1} = z_n^2 + c$ via `$Map`.
<p>Pixel intensity is the escape iteration count, raised to a power for contrast control. -->
